sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Admin
    participant GW as API Gateway Middleware
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant Coord as Coordinator / Core FSM

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/auth/login {username: "client1", password: "pwd"}
    GW->>Auth: Authenticate(credentials)
    Auth->>Auth: Verify PBKDF2/Argon2 password hash
    Auth->>Auth: Generate Signed JWT (HMAC-SHA256)<br/>claims: {sub, owner_id, role, exp}
    Auth-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK {access_token: "jwt...", expires_in: 86400}

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/locks/acquire<br/>Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
    GW->>RL: CheckRateLimit(authenticated_subject)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        RL-->>Client: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests
    else Within Rate Limits
        RL-->>GW: Allow Request
    end

    GW->>Auth: ValidateToken(jwt)
    alt Token Invalid / Expired
        Auth-->>Client: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid Token
        GW->>GW: RBAC Check (Role 'client' allowed for Acquire)
        alt Role Denied (e.g. 'read-only' attempting mutate)
            GW-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden
        else Role Authorized
            GW->>Coord: Forward Authorized Request (OwnerID injected)
            Coord-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Lock Granted)
        end
    end

